[{"answer":"Time is something you should never waste.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/97-time-2019-04-07-03-52-25/1.mp3"},{"answer":"Once an hour is gone, it is gone forever.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/97-time-2019-04-07-03-52-25/2.mp3"},{"answer":"You should make the most of every minute.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/97-time-2019-04-07-03-52-25/3.mp3"},{"answer":"Time is a funny thing.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/97-time-2019-04-07-03-52-25/4.mp3"},{"answer":"Some days go by so slowly.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/97-time-2019-04-07-03-52-25/5.mp3"},{"answer":"Those are the days that you do things that aren't fun.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/97-time-2019-04-07-03-52-25/6.mp3"},{"answer":"When you are having fun, time just flies by.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/97-time-2019-04-07-03-52-25/7.mp3"},{"answer":"Time is made up of different units.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/97-time-2019-04-07-03-52-25/8.mp3"},{"answer":"Seconds turn into minutes.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/97-time-2019-04-07-03-52-25/9.mp3"},{"answer":"Minutes turn into hours.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/97-time-2019-04-07-03-52-25/10.mp3"},{"answer":"Hours turn into days.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/97-time-2019-04-07-03-52-25/11.mp3"},{"answer":"Days turn into weeks.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/97-time-2019-04-07-03-52-25/12.mp3"},{"answer":"Weeks turn into months,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/97-time-2019-04-07-03-52-25/13.mp3"},{"answer":"and months turn into years.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/97-time-2019-04-07-03-52-25/14.mp3"},{"answer":"We measure our lives by time.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/97-time-2019-04-07-03-52-25/15.mp3"},{"answer":"We are very concerned with time.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/97-time-2019-04-07-03-52-25/16.mp3"},{"answer":"Even little children are very conscious of time.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/97-time-2019-04-07-03-52-25/17.mp3"},{"answer":"Little children often want to appear older,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/97-time-2019-04-07-03-52-25/18.mp3"},{"answer":"so if you ask a 3-year-old how old he is,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/97-time-2019-04-07-03-52-25/19.mp3"},{"answer":"he will often say three and a half.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/97-time-2019-04-07-03-52-25/20.mp3"},{"answer":"Many of our sayings are based on time.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/97-time-2019-04-07-03-52-25/21.mp3"},{"answer":"\"Give me a minute\". \"Hold on a second\".","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/97-time-2019-04-07-03-52-25/22.mp3"},{"answer":"\"I'm running out of time\". \"Time's up\".","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/97-time-2019-04-07-03-52-25/23.mp3"},{"answer":"\"I just want an hour of your time\".","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/97-time-2019-04-07-03-52-25/24.mp3"},{"answer":"All of these are common things that we say,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/97-time-2019-04-07-03-52-25/25.mp3"},{"answer":"and they're all based on time.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/97-time-2019-04-07-03-52-25/26.mp3"},{"answer":"We are a society that lives by the clock.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/97-time-2019-04-07-03-52-25/27.mp3"},{"answer":"We almost all wear watches, and we glance at our watches a lot.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/97-time-2019-04-07-03-52-25/28.mp3"},{"answer":"Time is something that we can't see,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/97-time-2019-04-07-03-52-25/29.mp3"},{"answer":"but it is a big factor in our lives.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/97-time-2019-04-07-03-52-25/30.mp3"},{"answer":"How many times a day do you look at a watch or a clock?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/97-time-2019-04-07-03-52-25/31.mp3"},{"answer":"I bet you'd be surprised at just how many times you do.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/97-time-2019-04-07-03-52-25/32.mp3"}]
